   "wikipedia": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Eat_to_the_Beat",
   "resumo_en": "Eat to the Beat is the fourth studio album by American rock band Blondie, released on September 28, 1979 by Chrysalis Records. The album spent a year on the US Billboard 200, peaking at No. 17 and was one of Billboard's top 10 albums of 1980. It also reached No. 1 on the UK Albums Chart in October 1979, becoming the band's second top album there that year. It has been certified Platinum by the British Phonographic Industry (BPI) and the Recording Industry Association of America (RIAA).",
